VectorCraft v0.21.0-android.14 DIAGNOSTICS ONLY ARM64 TEST, disposable signature and separate com.artcraft.vectorcraft.test install.
Owner source commit 0168a8b1d1e30e3f3ec0c2238dc940b2d26b9d4d.
Goal: ONE reusable on-device capture, not another speculative behaviour fix.
Panel: Vc > Diagnostics > Keyboard Diagnostics > Diagnostic Session. User-triggered Start/Reset, Stop, Refresh Snapshot, Copy Report; bounded privacy-safe keyboard-route and focus transitions, startup stage persistence, no user text, filenames, document content or upload. Throttle Android UI probes to 2Hz.
Strict Python/real generated Rust/Java preflight, Rust behavioural gates, ARM64 package and disposable signature verification. Never permanent-sign, merge or publish and do not modify other apps.
